{
  "Package": "immReferent",
  "Title": "An Interface for Immune Receptor and HLA Gene Reference Data",
  "Version": "0.99.6",
  "Authors@R": "c(\nperson(given = \"Nick\", family = \"Borcherding\", role = c(\"aut\", \"cre\"), email = \"ncborch@gmail.com\"))",
  "Description": "Provides a consistent interface for downloading, storing,\nand accessing immune receptor (TCR/BCR) and HLA sequences from\nIMGT, IPD-IMGT/HLA, and OGRDB (AIRR-C). Supports export to\npopular analysis tools including MiXCR, TRUST4, Cell Ranger,\nand IgBLAST. This package serves as a core dependency for\nimmunogenomics packages, ensuring reliable and high-quality\nsequence access with local caching for reproducibility.",
